{"2761800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "COMBAT PILOT: CARRIER QUALIFICATION", "steam_appid": 2761800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for checking out <strong>Combat Pilot: Carrier Qualification</strong> - a new hardcore flight-simulator for the PC set in the Pacific Theater during WWII. Carrier Qualification is our inaugural title which we hope will be the first of many more to come. We plan to bring intense aerial combat to your computer in future titles, but first you need to learn how to take-off and land on an aircraft carrier!<br><br>Combat Pilot is the first hardcore flight-simulator to harness the power and flexibility of Unreal Engine 5. We have combined our own proprietary flight and physics engine (EntropyFM) with UE5 to make it not only the world’s leading game engine, but also a truly modern flight-sim engine.<br><br>Carrier Qualification lays the foundation for future Combat Pilot titles and focuses on the fundamentals of flight and operating a WWII warbird. Future Combat Pilot titles will build upon Carrier Qualification and come together to create a comprehensive combat flight-sim experience.<br><br>Carrier Qualification includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to create Quick Missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flyable US Navy / Marine Corps F4F-4 fighter and Imperial Japanese Navy A6M2 Model 21 &quot;Zero&quot; fighter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >USS Enterprise and IJN Akagi aircraft carriers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic flight physics and systems modeling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic carrier take-offs and landings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Midway Atoll (Sand and Eastern Islands)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>Combat Pilot is property of <strong>Combat Pilot LLC </strong>and is being developed by <strong>Entropy Aero</strong>, a subsidiary of <strong>Barbedwire Studios</strong>. Team members include veterans of the <strong>Gates of Hell</strong> real-time tactical strategy series. Entropy Aero also employs several aerospace industry experts utilizing the latest in computational technology and tools along with veterans of other combat flight-sim franchises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for checking out <strong>Combat Pilot: Carrier Qualification</strong> - a new hardcore flight-simulator for the PC set in the Pacific Theater during WWII. Carrier Qualification is our inaugural title which we hope will be the first of many more to come. We plan to bring intense aerial combat to your computer in future titles, but first you need to learn how to take-off and land on an aircraft carrier!<br><br>Combat Pilot is the first hardcore flight-simulator to harness the power and flexibility of Unreal Engine 5. We have combined our own proprietary flight and physics engine (EntropyFM) with UE5 to make it not only the world’s leading game engine, but also a truly modern flight-sim engine.<br><br>Carrier Qualification lays the foundation for future Combat Pilot titles and focuses on the fundamentals of flight and operating a WWII warbird. Future Combat Pilot titles will build upon Carrier Qualification and come together to create a comprehensive combat flight-sim experience.<br><br>Carrier Qualification includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to create Quick Missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flyable US Navy / Marine Corps F4F-4 fighter and Imperial Japanese Navy A6M2 Model 21 &quot;Zero&quot; fighter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >USS Enterprise and IJN Akagi aircraft carriers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic flight physics and systems modeling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic carrier take-offs and landings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Midway Atoll (Sand and Eastern Islands)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>Combat Pilot is property of <strong>Combat Pilot LLC </strong>and is being developed by <strong>Entropy Aero</strong>, a subsidiary of <strong>Barbedwire Studios</strong>. Team members include veterans of the <strong>Gates of Hell</strong> real-time tactical strategy series. Entropy Aero also employs several aerospace industry experts utilizing the latest in computational technology and tools along with veterans of other combat flight-sim franchises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Combat Pilot is a hardcore combat flight-simulation set in the Pacific Theater during WWII. Our Carrier Qualification title represents the first step in the product's roadmap, offering basic carrier and land operations for the legendary USN/USMC F4F-4 and IJN A6M2 Mod.21 &quot;Zero&quot; fighter planes.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761800/b847b24094048a4fe4d33ad46a13f47436cf53ce/header.jpg?t=1776688086", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761800/2cfe4846219b23c75cfea146d536e6d362f96e8e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776688086", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761800/2cfe4846219b23c75cfea146d536e6d362f96e8e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776688086", "website": "https://combatpilot.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 7 3700X / Intel Core i7-9700K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 3060 / AMD RX 6600 XT (For VR: RTX 4070 / AMD 7800 XT)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> To be determined<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> VR support is featured, but is not required<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> TrackIR supported. Other head trackings not yet supported, but will be.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 7 9700X / Intel Core i7-14700K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 64 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 4070 / AMD 7800 XT (For VR: RTX 4080 / AMD RX 7900 XTX)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> To be determined<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> VR support is featured, but is not required<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> TrackIR supported. Other head trackings not yet supported, but will be</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "legal_notice": "© 2024-26 Combat Pilot LLC", "developers": ["Entropy.Aero"], "publishers": ["Combat Pilot LLC"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 18, "description": "Partial Controller Support"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a